      "source": [
        {
          "question": "e-6778",
          "field": null,
          "attribute": "question/worked-solution",
          "value": "We consider the augmented matrix $[A\\,|\\,I]$ where $I$ is the $3\\times 3$ identity. Applying the indicated row operations we have\n![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14058199/assets/cd018c9d74dfe459131b33723d784af1cd97434f812a8bc8142da5832b943b95.png)\n\nTherefore, the required row operations are $R_3 := (-1) R_3$ and $R_1 := R_1+(-4)R_3,$ and inverse matrix is \n![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14058199/assets/c5b78f969ba52a5a19ac41ddbde2f5623c70af98d4cca190b2df93b4a9bd7071.png)",
